6309118.385900","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-denops/deno-denops-std/blob/main/denops_std/README.md | README.md\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-denops/deno-denops-std/blob/main/denops_std/README.md | README.md\u003e","text":"*denops_std*\n\n\u003chttps://deno.land/x/denops_std|deno land\u003e  \n\u003chttps://doc.deno.land/https/deno.land/x/denops_std/mod.ts|deno doc\u003e  \n\u003chttps://github.com/vim-denops/deno-denops-std/actions/workflows/test.yml|Test\u003e\n\n\u003chttps://deno.land/|Deno\u003e module for \u003chttps://github.com/vim-denops/denops.vim|denops.vim\u003e. This module is assumed to be  \nused in denops plugin and the code is assumed to be called in a worker thread  \nfor a plugin.\n\nBy using this module, developers can write Vim/Neovim denops plugins like:\n\n```\nimport { Denops } from \"\u003chttps://deno.land/x/denops_std/mod.ts\u003e\";\nimport * as fn from \"\u003chttps://deno.land/x/denops_std/function/mod.ts\u003e\";\nimport * as vars from \"\u003chttps://deno.land/x/denops_std/variable/mod.ts\u003e\";\nimport { execute } from \"\u003chttps://deno.land/x/denops_std/helper/mod.ts\u003e\";\nimport { ensureString } from \"\u003chttps://deno.land/x/unknownutil/mod.ts\u003e\";\n\nexport async function main(denops: Denops): Promise\u0026lt;void\u0026gt; {\n  denops.dispatcher = {\n    async say(where: unknown): Promise\u0026lt;void\u0026gt; {\n      // Ensure that `where` is `string` here\n      ensureString(where);\n      // Use `call` to call Vim's function\n      const name = await fn.input(denops, \"Your name: \");\n      // Use `eval` to evaluate Vim's expression\n      const progname = await vars.v.get(denops, \"progname\");\n      // Construct messages\n      const messages = [\n        `Hello ${where}`,\n        `Your name is ${name}`,\n        `This is ${progname}`,\n      ];\n      // Use `cmd` to execute Vim's command\n      await denops.cmd(`redraw | echomsg message`, {\n        message: messages.join(\". \"),\n      });\n    },\n  };\n\n  // Use 'execute()' to execute multiline Vim script\n  await execute(\n    denops,\n    `\n    command! HelloWorld call denops#notify(\"${denops.name}\", \"say\", [\"World\"])\n    command! HelloDenops call denops#notify(\"${denops.name}\", \"say\", [\"Denops\"])\n    `,\n  );\n}\n```\n\nSee \u003chttps://github.com/vim-denops/denops-helloworld.vim|denops-helloworld.vim\u003e  \nfor more details.\n\n*Index*","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-denops/deno-denops-std|vim-denops/deno-denops-std\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CCM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"79ea791b-b2bf-4a4f-9363-e3b10d719cc7","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"最良は denops_std のヘルプですね","ts":"1626309071.385300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruho","count":3,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","UDDCM376D","U72TB62UF"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fh5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"56DD6B00-5A61-4F5E-98D0-0109B344594C","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"困ったらとりあえずハローワールド参照してる","ts":"1626307121.383900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U72TB62UF"]},{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]},{"name":"me-too","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4B5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0DD6E1ED-05AD-49FC-80CE-3789A55AC119","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"いつもサーバ再起動してる","ts":"1626307071.383400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fNV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"042bbab6-ef52-4902-aef2-237bca0843de","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"1回手をとめて、リファレンスを一通り目を通したほうがよさそうかー","ts":