:, rtm_secret_key, err)': E896: get() の引数はリスト型、辞書型またはBlob型でなければなりません^@ ```\nエラーになるようです…。","ts":"1626302493.373500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3Zy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"86795190-9171-42cf-8337-abf336f46e38","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"これですね\n\u003chttps://developer.mozilla.org/ja/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Functions/rest_parameters\u003e","ts":"1626302379.372400","attachments":[{"fallback":"残余引数 - JavaScript | MDN","id":1,"title":"残余引数 - JavaScript | MDN","title_link":"https://developer.mozilla.org/ja/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Functions/rest_parameters","text":"残余引数構文により、不定数の引数を配列として表すことができます。","image_url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/mdn-social-share.0ca9dbda.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"developer.mozilla.org","service_icon":"https://developer.mozilla.org/apple-touch-icon.0ea0fa02.png","from_url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/ja/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Functions/rest_parameters","original_url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/ja/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Functions/rest_parameters"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kbyHh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"93a42373-f886-4275-8698-d4a62b2be3ce","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"直した","ts":"1626302309.371800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"e4tva"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eb39b0bb-6d16-48b6-a334-8998060b16f7","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"`denops.call`の前にawaitも必要か","ts":"1626302291.371500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Evjxu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bba42095-2c62-4af6-ab32-6e727a0479d5","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"今回の例で言うと\n`const secretKey = await denops.call(\"get\", \"g:\", \"rtm_secret_key\", [\"err\"]);`\nこうするとよいはず","ts":"1626302250.371000","ed